<title>USA: TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL SPRINGS, Florida 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$245,000 America's Red Clay Tennis Championship on Tuesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>1-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Mariano Zabaleta (Argentina)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>4-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Emilio Sanchez (Spain)</p>
<p>6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Frederic Fontang (France) beat 6-Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 6-3</p>
<p>4-6 6-1</p>
<p>7-Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Sebastien Lareau (Canada)</p>
<p>6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Guillaume Raoux (France) 6-3 3-6</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Steve Campbell (U.S.) beat Vince Spadea (U.S.) 6-4 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Johan Van Herck (Belgium) beat Ramon Delgado (Paraguay) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-3</p>
<p>Doug Flach (U.S.) beat Nicolas Pereira (Venezuela) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>David Witt (U.S.) beat Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
